1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,674
The Umbrine lived in Aurel's fire and grew roads to the next stars.

2
00:00:08,383 --> 00:00:15,409
The Heliobane flew into the fire and killed it. One by one, the roads went cold.

3
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,611
Seven years after the Lance, Aurel is going out.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:30,968
The Concord's only road off its dying worlds is the Umbrine's: the strands, frozen to glass.

5
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:37,353
Six surveys rode the strands out. None came back.

6
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:43,062
Survey Seven, the Plumbline, went anyway.

7
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:50,601
Something warm was waiting on the line.

8
00:00:55,800 --> 00:01:01,750
The Plumbline came down on Halm, a cold world under a red sun.

9
00:01:03,617 --> 00:01:07,659
Surveyor Hesper Lind wakes on a frozen glass world.

10
00:01:09,617 --> 00:01:11,552
Farstrand.

11
00:01:28,333 --> 00:01:34,882
THE WARDEN: We grew the city out of the trees. Then the cold grew us into the city.

12
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,104
MOTT: Took your time, kiddo.

13
00:01:39,983 --> 00:01:44,615
THE HOLLOW BELL: We do not help you. We help the cold.
